# launch-inventory.allow — lane A. Owners review every change.
# Six tab-separated fields: path, rule, class, owner, expires, reason.
# debt + M6 hides a finding only while the script is report-only.
# not-agent + permanent hides a finding in report-only and in --enforce.
# A new finding needs a reviewed row in the same change. Milestone M6 passes --enforce.
agent/baselines/main.repo-score.json	host_home_seed	not-agent	lane-C	permanent	Jankurai baseline names a test and does not seed a home
agent/baselines/main.repo-score.json	managed_launch_without_connection_id	not-agent	lane-C	permanent	Jankurai baseline starts no agent and has no connection
crates/jeryu-api/src/web/agent_runs/handlers.rs	docker_or_podman_run	debt	lane-C	M6	Host docker launch of an agent run, removed at M6
crates/jeryu-api/src/web/agent_runs/handlers.rs	managed_launch_without_connection_id	debt	lane-C	M6	Agent-run launch has no connection_id until the vault
